{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Iqnq30vntt1793615059.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產東九龍凱匯分行高級資深分區營業經理王能表示，分行最新促成一宗觀月‧樺峯成交，單位為高層F室，實用面積769平方呎，採三房套房加儲物房間隔，單位座向正南方，享開揚市中心景，最新以1226萬元成交，折合實用呎價15943元。</p><p> </p><p>中原地產王能指，原業主於2014年9月以1140萬元購入物業，持貨12年，現轉手賬面可獲利86萬元離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:15.684767+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T18:38:15.053745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:21.639686+00:00","content_hash":"ed541074ce48283385eba8f65998651c46fa72022223080753f821f7fd173cd2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:15.684767+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}